gap=c('CLINICAL-GAP','Cancer benefit: Not established. The selected human efficacy evidence is anecdotal, while the animal studies give mixed results. This page has no controlled human trial establishing tumor response, longer survival or a safe cancer regimen. This describes the evidence reviewed here, not an exhaustive claim about every study that might exist.',[H,D,U,V],'Selected-source coverage as of October 27, 2026','No controlled human efficacy comparison is present among these cited studies.',['Guilford 2026, Case 6 and Limitations; Dogra 2018, Methods; Duan 2012/2013, study methods'],['Human case reporting and nonclinical experiments, not a human comparative trial.','No direct comparative human cancer evidence in these sources.','No human benefit estimate can be calculated.','Mixed preclinical findings do not resolve the human evidence gap.','Identities and selected source text checked; search completeness and human approval are not claimed.'],'not_established')
