hedge=c('HEDGEHOG','Hedgehog or NPC1 cholesterol-transport mechanism: Not established for fenbendazole in the evidence reviewed here. The cited fenbendazole experiments test microtubules, cell stress, p53 and metabolic effects; they do not demonstrate a Hedgehog or NPC1-mediated anticancer effect. Findings for a different drug cannot supply that missing evidence.',[D,T,P],'Limits of mechanism coverage in the selected fenbendazole experiments','The selected studies do not test the claimed Hedgehog/NPC1 cancer mechanism; this is a coverage gap, not proof that such a mechanism is impossible.',['Dogra 2012/2018, Results and Discussion; Park H4IIE 2022, Abstract and Results'],['Mechanistic assays address other pathways.','No direct fenbendazole Hedgehog/NPC1 cancer experiment among these sources.','No effect estimate for the absent pathway question.','No supporting experiment identified in the reviewed packet; no class transfer.','Original identities and selected text verified; absence statement bounded to reviewed evidence.'],'not_established')
